; cluster for calculus quantities: derivatives, integrals, limits, series.
; calculus studies continuous change — how quantities vary with respect to others.
; kramanusara (derivative) and sama-kalana (integral) are the two operations.
; sangati roots

(kosha calculus-varga
  (vishesa math-varga)
  (swarupa kramanusara)
  (yukta kaala seema niyama viveka))
